{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26234","headline":"登凤凰台二首 一 · 殷尧藩","name":"登凤凰台二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤凰台上望长安，五色宫袍照水寒。\n彩笔十年留翰墨，银河一夜卧阑干。\n三山飞鸟江天暮，六代离宫草树残。\n始信人生如一梦，壮怀莫使酒杯乾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}